I've tested for all the day in OpenWRT linux kernel version 2.6.24.2 the 
Batman Advanced revision 1075 and I've found a bug (Unable to handle 
kernel paging request at virtual address 00002710). The ping's reciver 
pc always crash at ping request. It's impossible  to see the log  file  
(obviously  for the crash). I attach the kernel oops at the email.

Regards

Paolo

